cartridge "POULET CONTRE ZOMBIE/AMY & CLAUDE/2026"

' POULET CONTRE ZOMBIE - an original ColecoVision game in three acts.
' ACT I, HALLOWEEN: "ZOMBIE BOTTE POULET". Amy & Claude 2026, made in Amy
' with Amy Studio. Built by build.py from this file, art.py, font.py,
' pages.txt, music/*.txt and the AMYZ fast decoder (amyzf_vram.asm).
'
' THE GAME: you are a clumsy zombie in a backyard at dusk. A white plastic
' toy chicken waddles about on its own, like a wind-up toy. Kick it into the
' pumpkin baskets; farther baskets score more. The kick is charged: a short
' press kicks softly, a long press kicks hard, too long and the zombie loses
' his balance. A kick into thin air makes him spin. Every miss makes him
' dizzier; when the dizziness bar is full he trips over and lurches at the
' screen (a close-up), then "OUPS !" with a green goo splash: one life gone.
'
' CONTROLS: joystick to walk (floaty, with a lurching step now and then);
' hold a button to wind up the kick, release to kick; up or down while
' releasing sends the chicken on a slant.

' font: codes 32-111 (generated by art.py from font.py)

