' ================================================================== program
  mode 2 screen
  set sound table PzSoundTable areas MtAreas
  sprites 16x16
  nmi off
  copy SpPat count SpBytes to vram.spr_pat
  SpritesOff
  screen on
  CreditsScreen

title:
